-- =====================================================================================================
-- SynapseDC DC-STORE: fixes for the schema review of 06-Nov-2026 (docs/database/synapsedc_dc_store_review.md)
-- Run section 1 first. Every query there must return NO rows before section 2 is run.
-- Every statement was tested on MySQL 9.6 against a fresh copy of synapsedc_dc_store.sql.
-- The lasting fix belongs in scripts/db/build_schema.py, so the next generated .sql already includes it.
-- =====================================================================================================

